    <string name="xguard_note_title">What xGuard does</string>
    <string name="xguard_note_text">xGuard works in two layers. The filter list (the ad blocker, which every site setting for ads follows) takes the hosts on the list out of a page. The tracker blocker knows what kind of tracker a host is and stops the kinds that are switched on. The tracking analysis counts every request a page makes, so it can be seen what was stopped and what was let through. A site whose protection is switched off in the panel behind the shield keeps both layers off.</string>


